{"ts":"2026-06-03T05:45:01.590Z","author":"codex","op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-06-03T05:45:01.590Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-06-03T05:45:01.575Z","author":"codex","text":"DONE. The documented --no-preflight-network escape hatch was UNUSABLE: it was read in preflight but never declared as a command flag, AND pm strips '--no-' as boolean negation. Fixed by declaring '--skip-preflight-network' (preflight reads both new + legacy keys for back-compat). Verified accepted on 'linear sync' with clean USAGE on missing key."}]}],"before_hash":"52c29bbcb88ad0359c1cdd35491f171ff510627523d48dffa01e88e1c0343cc9","after_hash":"e9c532945df1676e57a94f127c42b8350b26261b3b658f5189592a4c535aa5c3"}
